2. Does Biotic cover more than 50% (considering the area sum of Biotic AND Abiotic)? > YES

3. Does Woody cover more than 50% (considering the area  sum of Biotic)? > NO

4. Does Herbaceous vegetation cover more than 50%  (considering the area sum of Not Woody vegetation)? > YES

5. Does Periodically herbaceous cover more than 50%  (considering the area sum of Herbaceous vegetation)? > NO

6. Does Permanent herbaceous cover more than 50%  (considering the area sum of Herbaceous vegetation)? > YES

#### 7. Permanent herbaceous

